# Local Worker runtime bindings for the FlopoCMS dev server (`astro dev` with
# platformProxy). This is the local mirror of the production Worker dashboard
# (vars + secrets): same keys, same meaning.
#
# Setup: cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars  # then fill in real values
# Production: set the same keys as vars/secrets on the `flopocms` Worker
# dashboard. GITHUB_PAT always as secret, never versioned.
#
# Single-source rule: a key lives HERE or in .env, never in both.
# Everything the Worker reads at runtime (getRuntimeEnv) belongs here.
# .env is only for Astro/Vite build-time and Node-only tooling.

# GitHub user PAT with push (scope `repo`) on GITHUB_REPO. Write-only:
# dashboard secrets cannot be read back, keep a backup outside the repo.
GITHUB_PAT=

# Content repo this deployment writes to (Post Bundles + public/uploads).
GITHUB_REPO=

# Repo-relative dirs. Defaults (env.ts) match these; uncomment to override.
# CONTENT_DIR=src/content/blog
# UPLOADS_DIR=public/uploads
